  "notes": "一个开关管好诊断数据。\n\n- 诊断数据改为一个统一开关：关闭后立即清除本机记录并请求服务端删除，此前明确关闭过的保持关闭。\n- 新增隐私说明，设置中可查看最近发送的诊断数据；条款更新时提示一次。\n- 订阅地址改存系统安全存储，macOS 使用钥匙串密钥保护本地数据。\n- 在线设备数在账号卡片、会员页与设备管理中统一显示。\n- 新增网络可达性测量，帮助改善线路可用性：只在前台运行，受诊断开关控制，省电模式下不做主动探测。\n- 内核更新至 mihomo v1.19.31 + 悦通补丁。\n",
  "notesEn": "One switch for diagnostics.\n\n- Diagnostics now use a single switch. Turning it off clears local records at once and asks the server to delete them; an earlier explicit opt-out stays off.\n- Adds a privacy notice and a settings page showing recently sent diagnostics; a one-time notice appears when the terms change.\n- Subscription URLs move into the system secure store, and macOS protects local data with a Keychain key.\n- The online device count reads the same way on the account card, member hub and device management.\n- Adds network reachability measurement to improve route availability: foreground only, governed by the diagnostics switch, with no active probing in battery saver.\n- Core updated to mihomo v1.19.31 with YueLink patches.\n",
